---
title: CI validation pipeline — every pull request
---
flowchart LR
  A["Push or<br/>pull request"] --> B["checkout<br/>and set up Python"]
  B --> C["gitleaks<br/>secret scan"]
  C --> D["yamllint"]
  D --> E["ci_validate.py<br/>schema · ATT&amp;CK · telemetry<br/>entities · alert details<br/>metadata bar · KQL lint · ledger"]
  E --> F["pytest<br/>rules · ledger · deployment templates<br/>backtests · documented numbers<br/>negative tests · Sigma converter"]
  F --> G["check_links.py"]
  G --> H["coverage.md and layer.json<br/>regenerate, diff must be clean"]
  H --> I["tests/atomics.md<br/>regenerate, diff must be clean"]
  I --> K["deploy/<br/>ARM templates regenerate,<br/>diff must be clean"]
  K --> L["workbook preview digest check"]
  L --> J["package_rules.py<br/>artifact upload"]
